E1 control cells: oracle and scope keys, refresh without invalidation, template presentation, thinking writer and the query-time view zero_Dm, with offline tests and a pin of the existing cells

The cells write from the same writer requests as existing cells wherever their design allows
(tests assert this with a recording fake writer); the pre-intervention hash assertion covers them;
a pin test fixes the requests, served contexts and item rows of the existing cells.

